He said he was surprised when the TSA called him Tuesday and asked him to meet them[ at] the U.S. Attorney Michael J.[ Sullivan]�s office in Boston.
�My lawyer said to me somewhere along the line someone did not get the paperwork,� said Grant, who is[ director of sales for Y]SI Life Sciences[, which] manufactures scientific instruments.
